<title>BRAZIL: Telebras Jan-Nov net 2.43 bln reais.</title>
<headline>Telebras Jan-Nov net 2.43 bln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's state-owned telecom company Telebras issued the following statement on its January-November consolidated results.</p>
<p>			    JAN-NOV 96		   JAN-NOV 95</p>
<p>    Net revenues	 11.3  bln		     N/A</p>
<p>    Net profit	    2.43 bln		     N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: No comparative and per share figures were provided.</p>
<p>In a statement, Telebras said its controlling company posted a net profit of 2.94 billion reais between January and November.</p>
<p>-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415</p>
